  "tags": ["A1", "Grammar", "Verbs", "Gerund", "ING", "Business"],
  "completion_message": "¡Muy bien! Ahora conoces los verbos que siempre van seguidos de otro verbo terminado en -ing (Gerundio).",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "stg_theory",
      "type": "lecture",
      "title": "Concepto Teórico: Verbos seguidos de -ing",
      "parts": [
        { "visual": "Mientras que algunos verbos usan 'to' (want to go), otros verbos SIEMPRE van seguidos de un verbo con -ing (Gerundio). No se traducen literalmente al español, en español seguimos usando infinitivos.", "audio": "While some verbs use 'to' like want to go, other verbs are ALWAYS followed by an I-N-G verb, called a Gerund." },
        { "visual": "Verbos clave de negocios que usan -ing: ENJOY (disfrutar), MIND (importar/molestar), FINISH (terminar), SUGGEST (sugerir), AVOID (evitar). Ejemplo: I enjoy working here (Disfruto trabajar aquí). Have you finished writing the report? (¿Has terminado de escribir el reporte?).", "audio": "Key business verbs that use I-N-G: Enjoy, mind, finish, suggest, and avoid. Example: I enjoy working here. Have you finished writing the report?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stg_quiz_choice",
      "type": "quiz_choice",
      "title": "Interactive Quiz",
      "description": "Elige la forma correcta del verbo.",
      "questions": [
        { "id": "a1-128-q1", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I enjoy ____ with this team. (Trabajar).", "options": ["working", "to work", "work", "worked"], "correct_answer": "working", "explanation": "Enjoy + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q2", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Have you finished ____ the email? (Escribir).", "options": ["writing", "to write", "write", "wrote"], "correct_answer": "writing", "explanation": "Finish + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q3", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Do you mind ____ the window? (Abrir - ¿Te importa abrir...?).", "options": ["opening", "to open", "open", "opened"], "correct_answer": "opening", "explanation": "Mind + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q4", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "She suggested ____ a new strategy. (Implementar).", "options": ["implementing", "to implement", "implement", "implemented"], "correct_answer": "implementing", "explanation": "Suggest + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q5", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We should avoid ____ mistakes. (Hacer/Cometer).", "options": ["making", "to make", "make", "made"], "correct_answer": "making", "explanation": "Avoid + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q6", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He finished ____ the code yesterday. (Programar/Escribir).", "options": ["coding", "to code", "code", "coded"], "correct_answer": "coding", "explanation": "Finish + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q7", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I don't mind ____ late today. (Trabajar).", "options": ["working", "to work", "work", "worked"], "correct_answer": "working", "explanation": "Don't mind + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q8", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "They enjoy ____ new clients. (Conocer).", "options": ["meeting", "to meet", "meet", "met"], "correct_answer": "meeting", "explanation": "Enjoy + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q9", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I suggest ____ the meeting until tomorrow. (Posponer).", "options": ["postponing", "to postpone", "postpone", "postponed"], "correct_answer": "postponing", "explanation": "Suggest + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q10", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Try to avoid ____ money on useless things. (Gastar).", "options": ["spending", "to spend", "spend", "spent"], "correct_answer": "spending", "explanation": "Avoid + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q11", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "She finished ____ the presentation at 5 PM. (Preparar).", "options": ["preparing", "to prepare", "prepare", "prepared"], "correct_answer": "preparing", "explanation": "Finish + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q12", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Would you mind ____ me that file? (Enviar).", "options": ["sending", "to send", "send", "sent"], "correct_answer": "sending", "explanation": "Would you mind + verbo-ing (forma muy educada de pedir algo)." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q13", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I enjoy ____ business trips. (Tomar/Hacer).", "options": ["taking", "to take", "take", "took"], "correct_answer": "taking", "explanation": "Enjoy + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q14", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He suggested ____ the budget. (Revisar).", "options": ["reviewing", "to review", "review", "reviewed"], "correct_answer": "reviewing", "explanation": "Suggest + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q15", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We must avoid ____ the deadline. (Incumplir/Perder).", "options": ["missing", "to miss", "miss", "missed"], "correct_answer": "missing", "explanation": "Avoid + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q16", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I haven't finished ____ this document. (Leer).", "options": ["reading", "to read", "read", "reads"], "correct_answer": "reading", "explanation": "Finish + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q17", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Does he mind ____ on weekends? (Trabajar).", "options": ["working", "to work", "work", "worked"], "correct_answer": "working", "explanation": "Mind + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q18", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We enjoy ____ problems. (Resolver).", "options": ["solving", "to solve", "solve", "solved"], "correct_answer": "solving", "explanation": "Enjoy + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q19", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "I suggest ____ to the manager first. (Hablar).", "options": ["speaking", "to speak", "speak", "spoke"], "correct_answer": "speaking", "explanation": "Suggest + verbo-ing." },
        { "id": "a1-128-q20", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "They avoid ____ risks. (Tomar).", "options": ["taking", "to take", "take", "took"], "correct_answer": "taking", "explanation": "Avoid + verbo-ing." }
      ]
    },
